    "name": "keyword-research",
    "description": "Discover, analyze, and prioritize keywords for SEO and GEO content strategies from a seed keyword or niche. Identifies high-value opportunities based on search volume, competition, intent, and business relevance. Generates topic clusters. For building a dated editorial calendar from your own Search Console data, use `content-planner` instead — this skill is seed-driven keyword discovery, not calendar scheduling. Use when asked to \"find keywords\", \"keyword research\", \"keyword analysis\", \"search volume\", \"keyword difficulty\", \"content ideas from a seed\", or any keyword discovery task.\n",
